Also, do note that Debug.Assert does not have the same effect as other assertions (as it disables release builds functionality). The Debug.Assert statement checks for true or false conditions in your code and when the condition is false, an Assertion exception is thrown. However, when the application is in release mode, the Debug.Assert statement will simply be ignored.

